      "extract": "The motion of a knotted charged fiber within a viscous liquid served as model for the definition of so-called \\emph{knot energies} introduced by Fukuhara~\\cite{fete}. One hopes that it will reach a stationary point minimizing its electrostatic energy and that the resulting shape will help to determine its knot type. The general idea is that this procedure leads to a ``nicer shape'' for a given knot in the same knot",
